supportsim
==========

This application computes sentence embeddings with the all-MiniLM-L6-v2 model:

  sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
  https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

  Trained by Nils Reimers (nreimers) and the sentence-transformers
  community, fine-tuned from Microsoft's MiniLM
  (nreimers/MiniLM-L6-H384-uncased, derived from microsoft/MiniLM-L12-H384-uncased;
  Wang et al., "MiniLM: Deep Self-Attention Distillation for Task-Agnostic
  Compression of Pre-Trained Transformers", 2020). Its WordPiece vocabulary is
  that of Google's BERT-base-uncased.

The model weights (model.safetensors) and vocabulary (vocab.txt) are NOT
included in this repository. They are downloaded from Hugging Face at image
build time by scripts/fetch-model.sh (pinned revision, SHA-256 verified) and
are redistributed, unmodified, only inside the built container image.

The inference code in internal/embed is an independent pure-Go
implementation written for this project; it contains no code from
sentence-transformers, Hugging Face Transformers, or PyTorch.
